WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:05.626
- I have never had ramen before.

00:00:05.626 --> 00:00:06.706
- I didn't know until two days ago

00:00:06.706 --> 00:00:09.118
that there was such a
thing as restaurant ramen.

00:00:09.118 --> 00:00:12.002
- Because I was vegetarian,
I never had experience

00:00:12.002 --> 00:00:14.283
with ramen, cause it had
animal byproducts in it.

00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:16.398
- I'm expecting slimy noodles

00:00:16.398 --> 00:00:18.643
and soup that's too salty.

00:00:18.643 --> 00:00:19.857
- I'm hopeful.

00:00:19.857 --> 00:00:20.990
I'm a little bit nervous.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.348
- I've had Vietnamese pho.

00:00:22.348 --> 00:00:23.819
I've had Thai boat noodles.

00:00:23.819 --> 00:00:25.194
- My name is Toshiro Tagami.

00:00:25.194 --> 00:00:27.535
I am a store manager of LA Artisan Noodle.

00:00:27.535 --> 00:00:29.634
I am very excited for you guys

00:00:29.634 --> 00:00:32.634
to try the ramen for the first time.

00:00:41.264 --> 00:00:42.617
- Here we go ramen.

00:00:42.617 --> 00:00:43.578
- Thank you.

00:00:43.578 --> 00:00:44.767
- I think I smelled seaweed.

00:00:44.767 --> 00:00:45.600
[Server] Yeah.

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:46.433
- Gross.

00:00:46.433 --> 00:00:48.157
- This doesn't look anything
like I was expecting.

00:00:48.157 --> 00:00:49.509
It looks eclectic.

00:00:49.509 --> 00:00:51.276
Hardy and eclectic.

00:00:51.276 --> 00:00:53.181
(slurping)

00:00:53.181 --> 00:00:55.336
(laughs)

00:00:55.336 --> 00:00:56.376
- I'm splashing all over myself.

00:00:56.376 --> 00:00:57.509
- But it's not a date food.

00:00:57.509 --> 00:00:58.714
- It's a little salty.

00:00:58.714 --> 00:00:59.714
- It's not too salty.

00:00:59.714 --> 00:01:00.694
- It tastes like chicken noodle soup.

00:01:00.694 --> 00:01:03.773
- It's like if gravy was
mixed with the chicken broth

00:01:03.773 --> 00:01:05.352
and kinda watered down a little bit.

00:01:05.352 --> 00:01:06.451
- That is really good pork.

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:07.766
- Pork isn't my favorite thing.

00:01:07.766 --> 00:01:09.189
- There's a slimy thing going on.

00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:11.625
- Juicy, it's salty,
it's all the good stuff.

00:01:11.625 --> 00:01:13.000
- I've never seen a brown egg.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:14.859
- I don't think I've ever had a whole egg

00:01:14.859 --> 00:01:16.804
since I was probably a small child.

00:01:16.804 --> 00:01:18.408
- I'm a fan. I'm a fan of the egg.

00:01:18.408 --> 00:01:19.325
- Passable.

00:01:20.274 --> 00:01:22.650
Actually, the aftertaste
or whatever it is,

00:01:22.650 --> 00:01:23.938
it gets a little bit better as you eat it.

00:01:23.938 --> 00:01:25.315
- It's good, it's
definitely growing on me.

00:01:25.315 --> 00:01:26.835
- I'm gonna have to order
stuff that's not sushi

00:01:26.835 --> 00:01:28.773
when I go to Japanese places now.

00:01:28.773 --> 00:01:29.987
- The more I eat it, the better it is.

00:01:29.987 --> 00:01:31.087
That's so weird.

00:01:31.087 --> 00:01:32.123
- This is like,

00:01:32.123 --> 00:01:34.526
if you added a Japanese
twist to Thanksgiving.

00:01:34.526 --> 00:01:35.459
- Now by the end,

00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:36.490
especially with that egg,

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.378
I'm like, I'm a fan.

00:01:38.378 --> 00:01:40.101
- Instant ramen's got nothing on this.

00:01:40.101 --> 00:01:41.698
This is like, legit.

00:01:41.698 --> 00:01:44.056
- But I'm not a full-blown believer.

00:01:44.056 --> 00:01:44.915
- I feel like I should have been

00:01:44.915 --> 00:01:46.279
introduced to this a long time ago.

00:01:46.279 --> 00:01:48.949
College students should
not be given the 45 cent

00:01:48.949 --> 00:01:52.354
plastic, red-wrapped, whatever that is.

00:01:52.354 --> 00:01:53.335
- This is what I want.

00:01:53.335 --> 00:01:54.612
When it's raining, with a book,

00:01:54.612 --> 00:01:56.112
I want some ramen.

